flowchart TD
    A[Microsoft-authorized Windows source] --> B[SourceIdentity + source validation]
    M[Signed/verified Build Manifest] --> C[Typed Manifest Executor]
    X[Versioned Component Matrix] --> C
    P[SplitOS package set] --> C
    B -->|SUPPORTED| W[Create immutable working copy]
    B -->|UNSUPPORTED / INVALID| F[BUILD FAILED]
    W --> I[Inventory offline image]
    I --> C
    C --> S1[DISM package/AppX/feature servicing]
    C --> S2[Typed service/policy baseline adapters]
    C --> S3[Stage SplitOS packages + setup provisioning]
    C --> S4[Stage recovery assets]
    S1 --> V[Offline postcondition verification]
    S2 --> V
    S3 --> V
    S4 --> V
    V -->|required predicate failed| D[Discard mount/workspace]
    D --> F
    V -->|all mandatory predicates pass| K[Commit transformed image]
    K --> O[Assemble bootable deployment source/media]
    O --> Q[Output verification]
    Q -->|failed| F
    Q -->|passed| R[BuildReceipt + verified baseline descriptor]
    R --> Z[Verified SplitOS Baseline artifact]
